# Mission Engine writes these configuration files itself using sorted,
# `json.dumps`-indented JSON. Prettier would fight the service and dirty the
# working tree after every dashboard change. Timestamped `.bak-*` copies are
# runtime backups and do not need formatting either.
services/mission-engine/config/*.json
services/mission-engine/config/*.bak-*
services/mission-engine/var

# The ACP registry is changed from the dashboard and serialized by the service.
# Prettier must not fight this persistent format after each account or agent is
# added.
services/agent/config/*.json
